- **Find your task.** Each task lists every file to create, the data shapes, the exact on-screen text, the behaviour and the tests. The shared **Project context** below applies to every task.
- **Working with an AI agent:** copy the **Project context** section below **plus** your whole task (from its `## TASK` heading down to the next `---` line), and paste both into your agent with this instruction:
  > Implement this ticket in my project. Create exactly the files listed, follow every rule and use the exact on-screen text given. Where the ticket gives code, use that code exactly. Then write the tests described. Before you finish, run `npx vitest run`, `npx tsc --noEmit` and `npm run lint` yourself and fix anything that fails. Do not edit any other files.
