- Export `async mockGetLearnContent(moduleId)`, `async mockGetQuiz(moduleId)`, `async mockGetChallenge(moduleId)`: wait `MOCK_DELAY_MS`; if `moduleId !== "1"` throw `new Error("Module not found")`; otherwise return the matching mock object.
